<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 78-4 IN REPLY TO NZ'S 586.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 78-4 IN REPLY TO NZ'S 586.</headline>
<dateline>DUNEDIN, New Zealand 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 78 for four wickets in reply to New Zealand's 586 for seven declared at the end of the second day of the first cricket test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand first innings 586 for seven wickets declared (B. Young 267 not out, M. Horne 66, S. Fleming 51, C.Cairns 70). Sri Lanka 78 for four wickets (S.Doull 3-32).</p>
</text>
